    "id": "goal-plan-stage-task-target-model-contract",
    "title": "Goal / Plan / Stage / Task target model contract",
    "sourcePath": "测试文档/fixture-d-goal-plan-task-state-model.md",
    "role": "target",
    "scope": {
      "text": "本文档是规划领域的 F40 目标数据模型契约，未来数据模型迁移在改动 models/、planner、replanner、storage 或页面数据消费前应以本文档为事实来源。",
      "sectionRefs": [
        "§Purpose"
      ]
    },
    "nonGoalSummary": {
      "text": "F40 不删除 DailyPlan[]、不改 storage key、不改兼容读取、不实现 AI 或 planner 重写；后续迁移步骤不得视作 F40 的一部分。",
      "sectionRefs": [
        "§Purpose",
        "§DailyPlan legacy boundary",
        "§Migration direction"
      ]
    }
  },
  "thesis": "目标核心链路是 Goal + UserProfile -> InitialPlanContext -> PlanBundle，重规划链路是 Goal + UserProfile + current PlanBundle + UserFeedback/DailyReview/Stage progress -> ReplanContext -> new PlanBundle/PlanChangeSet；DailyPlan[] 仅作为 legacy 兼容保留。",
